{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "6f8073f30ef26f18dacfebeb5b496891379f120f58f3cf7de8a441d8e35680d6", "ja": "トイカメラのPRイベント", "zh": "玩具相机的宣传活动", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5000_place", "source_sha256": "dc6e2aafeb9e125b69d1b143f05c66414e6e1a4f46c163a52a6d289efeef27c7", "ja": "学校", "zh": "学校", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5001_p", "source_sha256": "1ab15b66b4d0718c7fa2e84e48a811b73fe3885699b90b901fb5f7263ce597b5", "ja": "（今日は、学校でトイカメラの学生向けPRイベント。\n生徒達の前で、新商品を使って写真を撮る予定だ）", "zh": "（今天是在学校举办的面向学生的玩具相机宣传活动。计划在学生们面前使用新产品拍照）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5002_002chi", "source_sha256": "56af466395a33cdf31989641c6588403728e0996c43aab510b02d9f1b3d93651", "ja": "思ったよりもカメラが小さくて、驚きました。\n写真も、ずいぶん手軽に撮れるみたいですね。", "zh": "相机比想象中还要小，真让人惊讶。\n拍照似乎也方便多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5003_p", "source_sha256": "946678a90889b6942a82b2e35bd1d5ab0431743ec3754ad1f63f8a1443402e28", "ja": "ああ。操作がシンプルだから、\n初心者でも簡単に使えるのが魅力だと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。因为操作很简单，\n我觉得即使是初学者也能轻松使用，这点很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5004_002chi", "source_sha256": "0b66df3a8bebc5b3ba6cf32da22b1f2273bad1a86d9e85c05698328130ab5959", "ja": "それで、イベントで撮る写真なんですけど、\n何を撮ればいいか迷っていて……。", "zh": "另外，关于活动上要拍的照片，我正在犹豫该拍什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5005_002chi", "source_sha256": "44e0ba361c464ae16ed890de22f5882d4e9dc4c59dc0480526447ce2b6a6630f", "ja": "候補が2つあるんですが、青空の写真か、\n生徒の皆さんの写真、どちらを撮ればいいかと……。", "zh": "候选有2个，不过我在犹豫该拍蓝天的照片，还是拍各位学生的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5006_p", "source_sha256": "cd513fdedc6e284eebe1b556ce9ce1557867a5ade68d2581db13a10eb81600e8", "ja": "そうだな。\n千早が撮るなら……", "zh": "是啊。\n如果由千早来拍的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5007", "source_sha256": "c21dab3cc2fad905997c92ce8d0d8eb49c975ae71528c244ba4b0b57f96d9965", "ja": "青空の写真", "zh": "蓝天的照片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5008", "source_sha256": "ebe1d5b1e03358a07ee55f6438db0e071a090455e206b08a0b066d3a1238d4d1", "ja": "生徒達の写真", "zh": "学生们的照片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5200_p", "source_sha256": "39a81c660e0c6c75aa98568421766c4affd00a0b00fd38607f3257c8aedffff8", "ja": "青空の写真がいいんじゃないか？\n風景の方が、千早も撮り慣れてるだろうし。", "zh": "用蓝天的照片不是挺好的吗？\n风景的话，千早拍起来应该也更顺手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5201_002chi", "source_sha256": "9e91ae9af53ccb8a2dae4d1f7c16587b57709089ea066651383d2c9a668c4f9e", "ja": "そうですね。青空ならどこを切り取っても絵になります\nから、きっと生徒の皆さんにも魅力が伝わるかと。", "zh": "是啊。蓝天无论截取哪一处都很适合作画，所以学生们一定也能感受到它的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5202_002chi", "source_sha256": "cd2f03cfc209093c612db685d6366dedf0b1716ca16ea4f4c7aa312a0b39000f", "ja": "空は、日によって表情が変わるので、\n今日はどんな青空が撮れるか、楽しみです。ふふっ。", "zh": "天空每天呈现的样子都不一样，所以很期待今天能拍到怎样的蓝天。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5300_p", "source_sha256": "39a81c660e0c6c75aa98568421766c4affd00a0b00fd38607f3257c8aedffff8", "ja": "青空の写真がいいんじゃないか？\n風景の方が、千早も撮り慣れてるだろうし。", "zh": "用蓝天的照片不是挺好的吗？\n风景的话，千早拍起来应该也更顺手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5301_002chi", "source_sha256": "8c7c42785bbca519acd5063b1b094309540796839dadc3f0ca45679cb3469e73", "ja": "はい。風景写真なら、日頃から\n練習しているので、上手く撮れるかと。", "zh": "好的。如果是风景照片，我平时一直在练习，应该能拍得不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5302_002chi", "source_sha256": "e1703e95bd1a14ef9b326de88ff36ae7ccebb3243b9c600455a7ab1f17f1bf57", "ja": "使い慣れてるカメラではないので、少し不安ですが、\n私なりに心を込めて、撮ってきます。", "zh": "因为不是我用惯的相机，所以有点不安，不过我会用自己的方式倾注心意，好好拍回来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5500_p", "source_sha256": "70e1c2e6b95ecf2a9de6730cb1ed078f09c9b39d3bb07cc3f874fc1511ebdbf7", "ja": "生徒達の写真はどうかな？　普段あまり撮らないものに\n挑戦してみるのも、いいと思うぞ。", "zh": "拍学生们的照片怎么样？我觉得尝试一下\n平时不太拍的对象，也是挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5501_002chi", "source_sha256": "f02f39c2efd8fe40f0a812017809451bcc973bc81b326152e18c3c634d666e0b", "ja": "ええ。せっかくの機会ですから、私も、人物写真に\nチャレンジしたいと思っていました。", "zh": "是的。难得有这样的机会，我也一直想挑战一下人物摄影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5502_002chi", "source_sha256": "d394bf8d2f1828a95f6e15d4f332b25f4790f97beda5a8e15c22f938f4264572", "ja": "イベントを楽しんでいる皆さんを撮れれば、\n素敵な1枚になりそうですね。ふふっ。", "zh": "如果能拍下享受活动的大家，应该能成为很棒的1张照片呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5600_p", "source_sha256": "70e1c2e6b95ecf2a9de6730cb1ed078f09c9b39d3bb07cc3f874fc1511ebdbf7", "ja": "生徒達の写真はどうかな？　普段あまり撮らないものに\n挑戦してみるのも、いいと思うぞ。", "zh": "拍学生们的照片怎么样？我觉得尝试一下\n平时不太拍的对象，也是挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5601_002chi", "source_sha256": "d8728fdf007c8cc21a64e28505e7358573b2348fa9c9dc2a77d78a9908785c0e", "ja": "なるほど……。人を撮るのはまだ苦手ですが、\nイベントの記念にもなりますよね。", "zh": "原来如此……虽然我还不太擅长拍人，但也能成为活动的纪念，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_5602_002chi", "source_sha256": "e155cab6eff58a4c5551757a1bfa5882ef9d69f6abca3dd0cd6d8c5f584b2f1c", "ja": "それでは、頑張って撮ってみます。\n生徒の皆さんにとっても、いい思い出になればと。", "zh": "那么，我会努力试着拍下来的。希望对各位学生来说，也能成为一段美好的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
